  <section class="fc-commitment" aria-labelledby="fc-commitment-title">
    <div class="fc-wrap fc-reading">
      <span class="fc-eyebrow">Our Foundation</span>
      <h2 class="fc-heading" id="fc-commitment-title">Our Commitment</h2>
      <p>Fayetteville Fury is committed to creating an environment where players can develop as athletes and as people.</p>
      <p>Our club believes that soccer development extends beyond technical ability, tactics, competition, wins, and losses. We have an opportunity and a responsibility to teach teamwork, accountability, resilience, leadership, sportsmanship, respect, and confidence.</p>
      <p>Every player develops at a different pace. As players grow and teams become more competitive, differences in experience, ability, confidence, physical development, and understanding of the game will naturally become more noticeable. Those differences should never become a reason to criticize, isolate, embarrass, intimidate, or diminish another player.</p>
      <div class="fc-callout">We are one team.<span>We believe we can compete at a higher level when we lift each other up.</span></div>
      <p>This Code of Conduct establishes the expectations for players, coaches, parents, staff, volunteers, and others representing Fayetteville Fury.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

